{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41413","headline":"惜花寄孙员外 · 李建勳","name":"惜花寄孙员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝始一枝开，暮复一枝落。\n只恐雨淋漓，又见春萧索。\n侵晨结驷携酒徒，寻芳踏尽长安衢。\n思量少壮不自乐，他日白头空叹吁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}